# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Terraform
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local working state
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Never commit variable files with real values
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars.json
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json
!**/terraform.tfvars.example

# Plan artifacts (binary; per-run only)
**/tfplan
**/*.tfplan
**/plan.txt
**/plan-full.txt
**/drift.txt

# Override files
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json

# Lock files: COMMITTED for terraform/bootstrap and terraform/environments/poc
# (not ignored — see docs/decisions for rationale)

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.envrc
.direnv/
